PORTDIR output aGreaterThanB,aEqualsB,aLessThanB
PORTDIR inout 
WIRE s_signedLess bits=1
WIRE s_unsignedLess bits=1
WIRE s_signedGreater bits=1
WIRE s_unsignedGreater bits=1
FUNC|
FUNC|s_signedLess      <= '1' WHEN signed(dataA) < signed(dataB) ELSE '0';
FUNC|s_unsignedLess    <= '1' WHEN unsigned(dataA) < unsigned(dataB) ELSE '0';
FUNC|s_signedGreater   <= '1' WHEN signed(dataA) > signed(dataB) ELSE '0';
FUNC|s_unsignedGreater <= '1' WHEN unsigned(dataA) > unsigned(dataB) ELSE '0';
FUNC|
